00:00:59.533 --> 00:01:03.233
She's not ignoring me,
but it feels like she is.

00:01:03.904 --> 00:01:06.409
Hey, why do you think
she lied to me yesterday?

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:07.743
I'm sure she had good reasons.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:09.543
Hey, cut her some slack.

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:12.967
Being too clingy will turn her off.
You'll soon crash and burn.

00:01:14.633 --> 00:01:16.809
I guess your girlfriend
is upset again today.

00:01:16.833 --> 00:01:19.643
Jo Mi Rae is asking
what happened yesterday.

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:21.709
She says she's been down all day.

00:01:21.733 --> 00:01:23.543
What? I wonder what's going on.

00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:26.343
I tried not to bring this up,

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:27.752
but did you

00:01:27.776 --> 00:01:30.176
seriously think you looked
the coolest yesterday?

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.409
Yes, isn't that a given?

00:01:32.433 --> 00:01:35.743
Hey, to be honest, those guys
without shirts on were quite cool.

00:01:35.767 --> 00:01:36.943
Especially the one called Won Bin.

00:01:36.967 --> 00:01:38.143
Wow.

00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:40.009
Even his name was Won Bin!

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.800
You can't compete with
a guy with a name like that.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.776
Gosh, you should've just
ripped your shirts open too.

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:49.609
So are you saying

00:01:49.633 --> 00:01:52.243
that U Yeon was checking someone else out?

00:01:52.267 --> 00:01:53.876
My girl U Yeon isn't like that.

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:55.709
Have you ever heard of
'Seeing something can spark desire'?

00:01:55.733 --> 00:01:58.076
It's the only
Chinese-character idiom I know.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.067
I haven't!

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:06.876
Isn't that a four-character idiom?

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:07.877
A four-character idiom?

00:02:07.901 --> 00:02:09.120
Yes.

00:02:11.232 --> 00:02:12.809
Where's U Yeon?

00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:14.467
She left already.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.743
What do we do now?

00:02:18.767 --> 00:02:22.409
Without U Yeon, you'll make
excuses to go alone again.

00:02:22.433 --> 00:02:24.019
What's going on?

00:02:24.043 --> 00:02:26.033
Just tell me already.

00:02:28.633 --> 00:02:29.909
I like Tae Seon.

00:02:29.933 --> 00:02:31.576
I know.

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.400
Did you also know Tae Seon likes you?

00:02:35.333 --> 00:02:37.909
My head tells me it's not your fault,

00:02:37.933 --> 00:02:39.709
but I just got angry
whenever I saw your face.

00:02:39.733 --> 00:02:41.276
Don't worry. I'd never date him.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:42.543
Hey!

00:02:42.567 --> 00:02:43.943
Seriously, Yeom Se Ra.

00:02:43.967 --> 00:02:47.276
Do you know how infuriating it is
when you talk like that?

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:50.509
Pretending that nothing matters
and that you don't care what happens.

00:02:50.533 --> 00:02:54.367
I'm swallowing my pride here.
Do you have to be so dismissive?

00:02:57.433 --> 00:02:59.909
My dad got transferred out of town.

00:02:59.933 --> 00:03:01.143
What?

00:03:01.167 --> 00:03:03.304
Mom wants me to go to Germany,

00:03:03.328 --> 00:03:05.067
but I'm not sure yet.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:09.509
Part of me wants to try living with Mom,

00:03:09.533 --> 00:03:12.576
but I also feel bad for Dad.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:17.309
I haven't told Song yet,
so keep this between us for now.

00:03:17.333 --> 00:03:18.792
Okay,

00:03:18.816 --> 00:03:21.000
I won't say a word.

00:03:26.033 --> 00:03:29.343
I think I should go see U Yeon.

00:03:29.367 --> 00:03:30.809
I think something's up.

00:03:30.833 --> 00:03:32.128
Gosh. Seriously, dude.

00:03:32.864 --> 00:03:35.109
How in the world would you know that?

00:03:35.133 --> 00:03:37.009
A man's intuition.

00:03:37.033 --> 00:03:38.943
Intuition, my foot.

00:03:38.967 --> 00:03:40.376
Oh, come on.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.543
Since when do guys have intuition?

00:03:42.567 --> 00:03:43.743
Men just...

00:03:43.767 --> 00:03:45.064
Stop meddling and wait.

00:03:45.088 --> 00:03:46.943
No, I can't do that.

00:03:46.967 --> 00:03:50.133
If something happened, I need to know.

00:04:04.384 --> 00:04:06.409
Gosh, I don't even want to
imagine that possibility.

00:04:06.433 --> 00:04:08.109
What if it's really another guy?

00:04:08.133 --> 00:04:09.609
But you said it can't be Won Bin.

00:04:09.633 --> 00:04:10.943
You said you trust her!

00:04:10.967 --> 00:04:12.409
It's not that.

00:04:12.433 --> 00:04:14.643
Miss Piggy's so pretty, you know?

00:04:14.667 --> 00:04:16.427
Do you think guys will
just leave her alone?

00:04:16.767 --> 00:04:18.976
She doesn't say it, but there must be tons.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.043
- Gosh, just hang up.
- Still, U Yeon

00:04:21.067 --> 00:04:23.743
is principled, so I'm not really worried.

00:04:23.767 --> 00:04:25.776
But what if there are pests bothering her?

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.343
I doubt it, Gi Jeong.

00:04:27.367 --> 00:04:28.843
She's too nice.

00:04:28.867 --> 00:04:31.100
So she hates rejecting people.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:37.400
What in the world!

00:04:40.736 --> 00:04:44.009
Is the lab closed until
the end of this week?

00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:45.667
Yes.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:50.867
Hey!

00:04:52.448 --> 00:04:55.509
U Yeon! Are you okay?

00:04:55.533 --> 00:04:57.776
Get away from her!

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.400
Gi Jeong.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.809
Gi Jeong, wait.

00:05:03.833 --> 00:05:05.243
Was it this punk?

00:05:05.267 --> 00:05:07.307
The one that's been
making life hard for you lately?

00:05:08.704 --> 00:05:10.576
Don't worry. I'll handle this.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.543
But

00:05:12.567 --> 00:05:15.409
I get why you keep following U Yeon around.

00:05:15.433 --> 00:05:16.543
Sure.

00:05:16.567 --> 00:05:18.043
She's gorgeous.

00:05:18.067 --> 00:05:20.643
But she's taken.

00:05:20.667 --> 00:05:22.009
By none other than me!

00:05:22.033 --> 00:05:24.976
I, Nam Gi Jeong, am
Song U Yeon's boyfriend.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.133
So scram right now!

00:05:28.467 --> 00:05:30.143
Gi Jeong, it's not like that.

00:05:30.167 --> 00:05:32.633
It'll be over soon. Don't worry.

00:05:36.333 --> 00:05:37.909
Are you a college student?

00:05:37.933 --> 00:05:40.409
If you're, go hang out
with other college students.

00:05:40.433 --> 00:05:43.776
Stop showing off and trying
to seduce an innocent minor.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.909
If you don't back off, I'm calling the cops.

00:05:45.933 --> 00:05:47.943
- He's my brother!
- Hello, officer?

00:05:47.967 --> 00:05:49.943
My biological brother!

00:05:49.967 --> 00:05:51.600
What?

00:05:57.184 --> 00:05:58.743
Good evening, sir.

00:05:58.767 --> 00:06:00.567
I'm U Yeon's.

00:06:03.776 --> 00:06:07.000
I'm Nam Gi Jeong, U Yeon's guy friend,
pretending to be her boyfriend.

00:06:07.967 --> 00:06:09.843
U Seok, you go inside first.

00:06:09.867 --> 00:06:12.776
I need to talk with my friend for a bit.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:15.209
Have a good night, sir.

00:06:15.233 --> 00:06:18.209
Sir, please go in.

00:06:18.233 --> 00:06:19.867
Take care.

00:06:26.533 --> 00:06:28.443
Wow.

00:06:28.467 --> 00:06:30.476
I almost got into big trouble.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.009
Your brother's glare was no joke.

00:06:33.033 --> 00:06:34.243
I'm sorry.

00:06:34.267 --> 00:06:35.244
But for now,

00:06:35.268 --> 00:06:36.843
- since I said I'm your guy friend...
- Are you an idiot?

00:06:36.867 --> 00:06:39.743
Who would believe that?

00:06:39.767 --> 00:06:41.276
What do I do now?

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:43.376
Things were already
awkward between me and him.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:46.076
How can I face him now?

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.624
Gosh.

00:06:48.767 --> 00:06:50.504
Am I

00:06:51.552 --> 00:06:53.209
that embarrassing?

00:06:53.233 --> 00:06:54.833
What?

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:03.076
Why did you come?

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:04.243
You didn't even tell me you were coming.

00:07:04.267 --> 00:07:07.343
Are you mad I came unannounced?

00:07:07.367 --> 00:07:08.509
You don't like it?

00:07:08.533 --> 00:07:10.343
No, that's not what I meant.

00:07:10.367 --> 00:07:12.633
Why are you twisting my words?

00:07:20.352 --> 00:07:22.300
Let's sit for a minute.

00:07:39.968 --> 00:07:43.033
I thought something was going on with you.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:45.943
