00:12:37.267 --> 00:12:38.543
Were you being annoying?

00:12:38.567 --> 00:12:41.743
No, I was totally killing it.

00:12:41.767 --> 00:12:42.776
Then why would she be like that?

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:45.743
Who knows? That's why I'm frustrated too.

00:12:45.767 --> 00:12:48.209
Something must've happened.

00:12:48.233 --> 00:12:49.210
But she won't tell me.

00:12:49.234 --> 00:12:51.933
I guess she doesn't want to tell you.

00:12:53.184 --> 00:12:54.840
I don't think U Yeon

00:12:54.864 --> 00:12:57.309
likes me as much as I like her.

00:12:57.333 --> 00:12:58.976
