you can't even look me in the eye?

00:22:59.567 --> 00:23:01.143
Gi Jeong.

00:23:01.167 --> 00:23:03.943
Is this about me possibly
joining an agency?

00:23:03.967 --> 00:23:05.409
If you hate it, I won't do it.

00:23:05.433 --> 00:23:07.100
It's no big deal.

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:10.743
