00:27:36.067 --> 00:27:38.267
We even kissed so many...

00:27:40.320 --> 00:27:42.867
How many times?

00:27:44.928 --> 00:27:49.576
Geu Rin must feel
certain about her feelings.

00:27:49.600 --> 00:27:54.743
That's why your doubting feels
