be making Seon Ho upset.

00:30:24.704 --> 00:30:28.700
You should be understanding of that.

00:30:30.080 --> 00:30:31.543
Gosh, so heavy.

00:30:31.567 --> 00:30:33.109
Why is she so heavy?

