00:35:49.433 --> 00:35:51.300
No.

00:35:56.933 --> 00:35:59.800
Darn it, who's calling?

00:36:02.600 --> 00:36:03.643
Hello?

00:36:03.667 --> 00:36:05.767
It's me, Rin Rin.

00:36:08.416 --> 00:36:09.709
How'd you get my number?

00:36:09.733 --> 00:36:10.743
I'm blocking you.

00:36:10.767 --> 00:36:12.767
You'll regret it.

00:36:13.500 --> 00:36:15.133
What?

00:36:18.208 --> 00:36:20.416
[Geu Rin]

00:36:23.712 --> 00:36:25.343
Spit it out.

00:36:25.367 --> 00:36:28.976
If the seniors are conversing, the juniors
ought to excuse themselves from the room.

00:36:29.000 --> 00:36:30.909
Younger ones are so
disrespectful these days.

00:36:30.933 --> 00:36:32.543
- Total chaos.
- I'm leaving now.

00:36:32.567 --> 00:36:36.376
The upcoming A Midsummer Night's Dream
production has the original Broadway cast.

00:36:36.400 --> 00:36:38.909
You know the stage director
and crew came along too, right?

00:36:38.933 --> 00:36:41.176
- Should I?
- Of course.

00:36:41.200 --> 00:36:44.809
That stage director was my brother's
best friend during his studies abroad.

00:36:44.833 --> 00:36:48.800
So I begged him to pay a visit
to our school's studio theater.

00:36:49.600 --> 00:36:50.609
Why?

00:36:50.633 --> 00:36:52.509
Why else?

00:36:52.533 --> 00:36:54.776
It's for you.

00:36:54.800 --> 00:36:56.104
The pretext

00:36:56.128 --> 00:36:58.443
is that he's advising on the
stage design for our fall production.

00:36:58.467 --> 00:37:00.109
Does someone like that
really have nothing better to do

00:37:00.133 --> 00:37:02.133
than advising a college play?

00:37:03.136 --> 00:37:04.744
Geu Rin,

00:37:04.768 --> 00:37:05.809
it's me, you know?

00:37:05.833 --> 00:37:07.976
Heo Zero.

00:37:08.000 --> 00:37:10.200
I can make all things possible.

00:37:15.264 --> 00:37:16.243
[A Midsummer Night's Dream]

00:37:16.267 --> 00:37:18.409
What do you think?

00:37:18.433 --> 00:37:21.640
It's rare to get a chance to talk
with a stage director

00:37:21.664 --> 00:37:23.743
from Broadway.

00:37:23.767 --> 00:37:27.909
We're meeting at the studio theater
day after tomorrow at 6 p.m.

00:37:27.933 --> 00:37:29.809
Come by.

00:37:29.833 --> 00:37:31.700
I'll introduce you.

00:37:33.933 --> 00:37:36.109
Think about it and let me know.

00:37:36.133 --> 00:37:37.967
You got my number, right?

00:37:38.700 --> 00:37:40.333
I'll get going.

00:37:42.900 --> 00:37:44.800
The day after tomorrow at 6 p.m.?

00:37:45.433 --> 00:37:47.967
Yes, 6 p.m.

00:38:09.120 --> 00:38:10.943
He has an interesting way to agonize.

00:38:10.967 --> 00:38:13.133
How many hours has it been?

00:38:19.033 --> 00:38:21.343
Gi Jeong. Hey, Nam Gi Jeong!

00:38:21.367 --> 00:38:23.767
Don't call me. You're ruining my rhythm.

00:38:24.960 --> 00:38:26.776
Jo Mi Rae says,

00:38:26.800 --> 00:38:30.709
do not call or text U Yeon.

00:38:30.733 --> 00:38:32.409
Tell her I wouldn't even if she begged.

00:38:32.433 --> 00:38:33.809
That's not what I mean.

00:38:33.833 --> 00:38:36.433
Her mom confiscated her phone.

00:38:39.667 --> 00:38:41.300
What?

00:39:10.133 --> 00:39:11.476
Koo Seon Ho.

00:39:11.500 --> 00:39:12.943
Are you feeling okay?

00:39:12.967 --> 00:39:14.056
What?

00:39:14.080 --> 00:39:15.376
How did you know?

00:39:15.400 --> 00:39:17.033
Myeong Hun told me.

00:39:17.760 --> 00:39:18.943
What's Myeong Hun doing?

00:39:18.967 --> 00:39:21.243
He's like an owl, delivering messages.

00:39:21.267 --> 00:39:23.276
Well, are you okay?

00:39:23.300 --> 00:39:24.443
He said you went to rest.

00:39:24.467 --> 00:39:26.233
How did you know?

00:39:26.867 --> 00:39:29.209
Myeong Hun told me.

00:39:29.233 --> 00:39:31.333
Myeong Hun's an owl indeed.

00:39:32.928 --> 00:39:35.333
Shouldn't we talk?

00:39:39.167 --> 00:39:40.904
Well,

00:39:40.928 --> 00:39:42.500
why aren't you answering?

00:39:44.224 --> 00:39:45.576
You don't want to see me?

00:39:45.600 --> 00:39:47.409
It's not like that.

00:39:47.433 --> 00:39:48.676
I want to see you.

00:39:48.700 --> 00:39:50.576
Then why won't you answer?

00:39:50.600 --> 00:39:51.909
I have so much to say to you.

00:39:51.933 --> 00:39:54.676
Me too. I have so much to say to you too.

00:39:54.700 --> 00:39:56.743
But not right now.

00:39:56.767 --> 00:39:57.809
Not right now?

00:39:57.833 --> 00:39:59.043
No.

00:39:59.067 --> 00:40:01.609
After I wrap things up,

00:40:01.633 --> 00:40:04.167
let's meet up then.

00:40:05.567 --> 00:40:07.200
Fine.

00:40:08.896 --> 00:40:11.809
I don't get it but I'll do as you wish.

00:40:11.833 --> 00:40:13.643
Just don't take too long.

00:40:13.667 --> 00:40:16.033
Or I'll get upset again.

00:40:16.960 --> 00:40:18.476
Upset?

00:40:18.500 --> 00:40:20.400
You get upset too?

00:40:21.408 --> 00:40:23.943
I do get upset too, you know?

00:40:23.967 --> 00:40:26.343
I'm an interesting human being too.

00:40:26.367 --> 00:40:28.476
Okay.

00:40:28.500 --> 00:40:30.333
Wait just a little longer.

00:40:54.333 --> 00:40:56.033
What?

00:40:59.900 --> 00:41:01.533
Wait.

00:41:03.616 --> 00:41:05.643
Nam Gi Jeong?

00:41:05.667 --> 00:41:06.809
Well...

00:41:06.833 --> 00:41:09.567
Where's U Yeon?

00:41:11.296 --> 00:41:13.576
She won't be coming to
the study room anymore.

00:41:13.600 --> 00:41:14.676
Actually, she can't.

00:41:14.700 --> 00:41:16.743
Why not?

00:41:16.767 --> 00:41:19.109
I, Nam Gi Jeong, am
Song U Yeon's boyfriend.

00:41:19.133 --> 00:41:20.643
So scram right now!

00:41:20.667 --> 00:41:22.056
He's my brother!

00:41:22.080 --> 00:41:23.667
My biological brother!

00:41:26.048 --> 00:41:27.343
Did she find out about me?

00:41:27.367 --> 00:41:28.509
What?

00:41:28.533 --> 00:41:29.800
No,

00:41:29.824 --> 00:41:30.976
her mom found out about her drawings.

00:41:31.000 --> 00:41:34.009
- What?
- She found out U Yeon's going to SF.

00:41:34.033 --> 00:41:35.743
Her mom tore up her
drawings and went crazy.

00:41:35.767 --> 00:41:38.643
- What?
- She's grounded, so she can't come to study room

00:41:38.667 --> 00:41:41.309
and has to go straight home after school.

00:41:41.333 --> 00:41:42.709
Hey, Nam Gi Jeong.

00:41:42.733 --> 00:41:43.943
That aside,

00:41:43.967 --> 00:41:46.176
did something happen
between you and U Yeon?

00:41:46.200 --> 00:41:47.843
- What?
- By any chance,

00:41:47.867 --> 00:41:48.909
did you betray U Yeon?

00:41:48.933 --> 00:41:50.376
No.

00:41:50.400 --> 00:41:51.880
In any case,

00:41:51.904 --> 00:41:54.543
if you betray Song,

00:41:54.567 --> 00:41:56.300
I'll skin you alive!

00:42:02.080 --> 00:42:03.643
- Thank you, sir.
- Goodbye.

00:42:03.667 --> 00:42:05.367
- See you again, U Yeon.
- Take care.

00:42:07.067 --> 00:42:08.044
Good night.

00:42:08.068 --> 00:42:09.192
What?

00:42:09.216 --> 00:42:10.943
You're home early today.

00:42:10.967 --> 00:42:12.867
Welcome home, Dad.

00:42:18.000 --> 00:42:19.009
Who was that?

00:42:19.033 --> 00:42:21.209
U Yeon's tutor I told you about.

00:42:21.233 --> 00:42:23.713
I heard he always knows
exactly what's going to be on the test.

00:42:30.688 --> 00:42:33.043
Are you sure we're not
wasting time for nothing?

00:42:33.067 --> 00:42:34.609
That's enough.

00:42:34.633 --> 00:42:37.967
If tutoring were going to help,
her grades should've improved ages ago.

00:42:38.733 --> 00:42:40.309
I've told you countless times.

00:42:40.333 --> 00:42:41.376
Stop wasting money.

00:42:41.400 --> 00:42:42.909
But still...

00:42:42.933 --> 00:42:44.609
Enough!

00:42:44.633 --> 00:42:47.143
I'm traveling next week.
Pack my things in advance.

00:42:47.167 --> 00:42:50.167
Gosh, where to? For how long?

00:42:58.816 --> 00:43:02.009
You heard how worried Dad is, right?

00:43:02.033 --> 00:43:03.733
Worried?

00:43:05.824 --> 00:43:07.209
I'm telling you this just in case.

00:43:07.233 --> 00:43:10.667
Don't mention drawings
or whatever in front of your dad.

00:43:11.968 --> 00:43:13.700
Got it?

00:43:26.720 --> 00:43:29.243
U Dol, have some spinach too.

00:43:29.267 --> 00:43:31.016
Open up.

00:43:33.088 --> 00:43:36.776
Look at him. He's all grown up now
and doesn't want me to feed him anymore.

00:43:36.800 --> 00:43:38.643
He's in third grade. He's all grown up.

00:43:38.667 --> 00:43:41.043
How long are you going
to treat him like a baby?

00:43:41.067 --> 00:43:43.509
He only looks big. He's still a baby.

00:43:43.533 --> 00:43:46.967
He doesn't know how to
do anything besides studying.

00:43:50.240 --> 00:43:52.176
Dad.

00:43:52.200 --> 00:43:54.509
I'd like to talk to you about something.

00:43:54.533 --> 00:43:56.976
Sure, later.

00:43:57.000 --> 00:43:59.700
- U Seok, you've been at the lab lately...
- Later when?

00:44:00.512 --> 00:44:04.509
You always say that
but never actually listen.

00:44:04.533 --> 00:44:06.643
Dad's having an important
talk with your brother.

00:44:06.667 --> 00:44:08.643
As for me,

00:44:08.667 --> 00:44:10.664
I wish

00:44:10.688 --> 00:44:13.276
you'd scold me like Mom does instead.

00:44:13.300 --> 00:44:15.643
That would be so much better
than being treated like I'm invisible!

00:44:15.667 --> 00:44:17.843
Why are you acting up like this at dinner?

00:44:17.867 --> 00:44:19.743
Come on, U Yeon.

00:44:19.767 --> 00:44:21.976
- Get up.
- Why don't you hear her out first

00:44:22.000 --> 00:44:23.667
to find out what she has to say.

00:44:25.408 --> 00:44:27.933
But please finish your dinner first.

00:44:33.920 --> 00:44:35.496
Let's take some time

00:44:35.520 --> 00:44:37.400
to talk after dinner.

00:44:46.944 --> 00:44:49.676
Though I believed I could convince them,

00:44:49.700 --> 00:44:53.033
part of me still feared I might fail.

00:44:53.856 --> 00:44:57.409
So Dad's answer didn't shock me.

00:44:57.433 --> 00:44:59.600
Because it was as expected.

00:45:00.800 --> 00:45:03.809
What truly disappointed me

00:45:03.833 --> 00:45:06.333
was my own pathetic self.

00:45:08.384 --> 00:45:11.576
The moment I faced Dad's stern expression,

00:45:11.600 --> 00:45:14.567
my heart started to race
and mind went blank.

00:45:15.488 --> 00:45:19.133
All I managed was to
let out a few stumbling words.

00:45:19.936 --> 00:45:21.733
No.

00:45:22.933 --> 00:45:24.712
I won't allow it,

00:45:24.736 --> 00:45:26.276
okay?

00:45:26.300 --> 00:45:28.200
Consider this conversation never happened.

00:46:07.767 --> 00:46:11.592
Why did you bring that up
knowing that it'd go nowhere?

00:46:11.616 --> 00:46:14.476
Look at how you've ruined
the whole family's mood.

00:46:14.500 --> 00:46:17.367
Now I have to tiptoe
around Dad because of you.

00:46:25.267 --> 00:46:27.843
What exactly do you do at home?

00:46:27.867 --> 00:46:29.276
What have you been
doing to make her like that?

00:46:29.300 --> 00:46:31.309
Why are you blaming me again?

00:46:31.333 --> 00:46:33.676
You just hang around other moms all day.

00:46:33.700 --> 00:46:34.876
That's exactly why
she turned out like that!

00:46:34.900 --> 00:46:36.276
What about you?

00:46:36.300 --> 00:46:38.476
You come home only on weekends.
You never look after kids!

00:46:38.500 --> 00:46:40.943
Then you go earn money!

00:46:40.967 --> 00:46:45.433
If you hadn't held me back, I wouldn't have
ended up in that countryside, you hear me?

00:47:51.168 --> 00:47:53.467
I want to die.

00:47:56.000 --> 00:47:57.633
Gi Jeong.

00:48:04.800 --> 00:48:06.443
Come straight home after school.

00:48:06.467 --> 00:48:08.709
Don't keep your tutor waiting.

00:48:08.733 --> 00:48:10.333
Okay.

00:48:12.800 --> 00:48:15.809
U Dol! Song U Dol!

00:48:15.833 --> 00:48:17.576
Time to wake up.

00:48:17.600 --> 00:48:21.809
A prince shouldn't sleep
in this late, you know?

00:48:21.833 --> 00:48:25.243
Will you get up yourself?
Or should I come in?

00:48:25.267 --> 00:48:27.300
Can you do it on your own?

00:48:27.933 --> 00:48:29.800
I'm coming in.

00:48:40.700 --> 00:48:41.809
Wait.

00:48:41.833 --> 00:48:43.843
U Dol, that's your
brother-in-law over there.

00:48:43.867 --> 00:48:45.976
Brother-in-law.

00:48:46.000 --> 00:48:47.633
Ice cream.

00:48:49.033 --> 00:48:51.109
Here you go, Bong Gu.

00:48:51.133 --> 00:48:52.909
My mom will be here soon.

00:48:52.933 --> 00:48:54.216
You'll be in trouble

00:48:54.240 --> 00:48:56.376
if she finds out.

00:48:56.400 --> 00:48:57.909
Is she coming to pick you up?

00:48:57.933 --> 00:48:58.943
It must be so tough for her.

00:48:58.967 --> 00:49:00.176
Don't you hate my mom?

00:49:00.200 --> 00:49:02.843
The reason U Yeon keeps you
a secret is because of her.

00:49:02.867 --> 00:49:04.043
Because my mom has a terrible personality.

00:49:04.067 --> 00:49:06.209
You shouldn't say that about your mom.

00:49:06.233 --> 00:49:08.076
Moms and Dads are all like that.

00:49:08.100 --> 00:49:09.443
They're just worried, that's all.

00:49:09.467 --> 00:49:12.267
He's right, U Dol. What's wrong?

00:49:13.824 --> 00:49:16.109
Why are you pretending to be nice?

00:49:16.133 --> 00:49:18.476
My mom has a terrible personality.

00:49:18.500 --> 00:49:20.043
She tore up U Yeon's drawings too.

00:49:20.067 --> 00:49:22.076
That's why I came.

00:49:22.100 --> 00:49:23.624
How's your sister?

00:49:23.648 --> 00:49:26.609
- Is everything okay?
- She's fine.

00:49:26.633 --> 00:49:29.933
She's just obeying my mom like an idiot.

00:49:40.512 --> 00:49:42.533
What are you doing?

00:49:45.267 --> 00:49:46.743
That's my number.

00:49:46.767 --> 00:49:50.120
If anything happens to your sister,
please call me.

00:49:50.144 --> 00:49:51.776
Promise?

00:49:51.800 --> 00:49:53.280
I'll get going now.

00:49:53.952 --> 00:49:56.088
I don't hate your mom,

00:49:56.112 --> 00:49:57.800
but she scares me.

00:49:59.467 --> 00:50:02.100
Wow, he's fast.

00:50:04.360 --> 00:50:06.048
[Giant Creep]

00:50:07.968 --> 00:50:10.309
He asked if you were okay.

00:50:10.333 --> 00:50:11.933
Give him a call.

00:50:18.560 --> 00:50:21.533
No, it's okay.

00:50:25.967 --> 00:50:27.667
Coward.

00:50:28.333 --> 00:50:29.933
What?

00:50:42.816 --> 00:50:44.584
Cuckoo,

00:50:44.608 --> 00:50:47.543
cuckoo, cuckoo.

00:50:47.567 --> 00:50:48.976
Over here.

00:50:49.000 --> 00:50:50.676
Cuckoo.

00:50:50.700 --> 00:50:52.333
Hey!

00:50:54.112 --> 00:50:55.833
Cuckoo.

00:50:58.033 --> 00:50:59.659
U Yeon,

00:50:59.683 --> 00:51:01.133
U Yeon!

00:51:09.600 --> 00:51:11.176
U Seok,

00:51:11.200 --> 00:51:12.443
what are you doing here?

00:51:12.467 --> 00:51:14.100
What?

00:51:15.776 --> 00:51:17.876
What's that?

00:51:17.900 --> 00:51:19.809
Where did you get that?

00:51:19.833 --> 00:51:21.467
It's mine.

00:51:24.367 --> 00:51:25.643
Don't tell Mom and Dad.

00:51:25.667 --> 00:51:27.309
What?

00:51:27.333 --> 00:51:28.933
Let's go.

00:52:20.640 --> 00:52:22.576
U Yeon.

00:52:22.600 --> 00:52:26.733
I was lucky to see you today.

00:52:28.192 --> 00:52:31.200
I still have so many
questions I want to ask you,

00:52:33.568 --> 00:52:35.367
but I'll hold back.

00:52:36.064 --> 00:52:40.392
It's okay if you never tell me.

00:52:40.416 --> 00:52:42.500
You must have your reasons.

00:52:43.936 --> 00:52:47.567
Meeting you taught me
that something like that exists.

00:52:49.568 --> 00:52:51.576
Also,

00:52:51.600 --> 00:52:54.909
I'm sorry for being pushy that day.

00:52:54.933 --> 00:52:56.900
I must've been out of my mind.

00:52:57.696 --> 00:53:02.536
I'm so embarrassed
that I can't even face you.

00:53:02.560 --> 00:53:04.808
Like you said,

00:53:04.832 --> 00:53:06.976
I'll keep waiting.

00:53:07.000 --> 00:53:09.376
If you won't forgive
me until the day you die,

00:53:09.400 --> 00:53:12.409
then I'll wait for you until the day I die.

00:53:12.433 --> 00:53:14.343
And this

00:53:14.367 --> 00:53:17.476
is the message I'll send when we make up.

00:53:17.500 --> 00:53:20.100
So don't make me wait too long.

00:53:21.133 --> 00:53:23.009
I miss you, U Yeon.

00:53:23.033 --> 00:53:29.143
♫ I run toward you until I'm breathless ♫

00:53:29.167 --> 00:53:34.409
♫ Even if I forget
everything, it doesn't matter ♫

00:53:34.433 --> 00:53:39.009
♫ I'll turn coincidence into destiny ♫

00:53:39.033 --> 00:53:44.809
♫ Now shout to the ends of the earth.
You're my destiny ♫

00:53:44.833 --> 00:53:47.209
I'm sorry. It's all because
I was being too petty.

00:53:47.233 --> 00:53:49.776
Something happened to your girlfriend's
family. The little one ran away from home.

00:53:49.800 --> 00:53:50.976
Even when we were dating,

00:53:51.000 --> 00:53:52.476
I always cared about Seon Ho more than you.

00:53:52.500 --> 00:53:53.676
Come back to me.

00:53:53.700 --> 00:53:55.276
I'll start fresh from that point.

00:53:55.300 --> 00:53:56.976
- Do what you want.
- U Seok!

00:53:57.000 --> 00:53:59.309
But do it smartly, so
that you don't get hurt.

00:53:59.333 --> 00:54:00.509
I should do it too. Dating.

00:54:00.533 --> 00:54:02.443
Today's main character is late.

00:54:02.467 --> 00:54:04.209
He's not getting a buzzcut, is he?

00:54:04.233 --> 00:54:05.509
No way.

00:54:05.533 --> 00:54:07.167
- Bong Gu.
- Oh no, Bong Gu.

00:54:07.967 --> 00:54:08.944
Why?

00:54:08.968 --> 00:54:10.709
What nonsense is this?

00:54:10.733 --> 00:54:12.476
Gi Jeong, you're right.

00:54:12.500 --> 00:54:13.576
I

00:54:13.600 --> 00:54:15.700
I've fallen for you.

00:54:22.240 --> 00:54:23.784
Wait,

00:54:23.808 --> 00:54:25.176
we're here already?

00:54:25.200 --> 00:54:27.667
We'll see each other again tomorrow.

00:54:28.832 --> 00:54:31.933
Let's just walk a little more
until we get to your place, okay?

00:54:35.840 --> 00:54:37.667
Wait.

00:54:41.312 --> 00:54:43.528
I don't want to leave.

00:54:43.552 --> 00:54:46.643
You have to. What if we bump into my mom?

00:54:46.667 --> 00:54:48.776
I'll greet her politely.

00:54:48.800 --> 00:54:50.643
Hello. I'm Nam Gi Jeong.

00:54:50.667 --> 00:54:52.509
Please entrust your daughter to me.

00:54:52.533 --> 00:54:55.343
She'll break my legs in two.

00:54:55.367 --> 00:54:56.376
This isn't the Joseon era, you know?

00:54:56.400 --> 00:54:59.967
She'll say, 'Your grades are bad.
You have no time for dating.'

00:55:01.504 --> 00:55:04.409
I want to grow up fast and rescue you.

00:55:04.433 --> 00:55:06.533
Just go already.

00:55:09.600 --> 00:55:12.067
Do you really have to go in right now?

00:55:13.792 --> 00:55:18.309
I think being 20 minutes
late should be okay.

00:55:18.333 --> 00:55:19.967
All right!